  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.online.s2": "Chapter I2: the process may be killed in the background; the message is in the on-disk outbox, so it is not lost.",
  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.online.s4": "Acing: the receiver checks for duplicates before showing, and sends a delivery confirmation back to the sender. [[src:book-acing]]",
  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.online.s5": "Acing: when the user reads the message, the app sends a read receipt to the sender, delivered the same way. [[src:book-acing]]",
  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.online.s6": "Alex Xu: each device keeps cur_max_message_id; new messages are those with a larger message_id. [[src:book-xu1]]",
