  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.offline.s5": "Acing: when the user reads the message, the app sends a read receipt to the sender, delivered the same way. [[src:book-acing]]",
  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.offline.s6": "Alex Xu: each device keeps cur_max_message_id; new messages are those with a larger message_id. [[src:book-xu1]]",
