  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.try": "Walk all six steps; at each, watch which components light up and the new rows in the sequence diagram.",
  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.online.s3": "Alex Xu: message_id must be unique and sortable by time; do not rely on created_at, as two messages can share it. [[src:book-xu1]]",
  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.offline.s3": "Chapter I5: you cannot tell a lost request from a lost response; retrying with the same key makes the server return the old result instead of a new copy.",
  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.away.s3": "Acing: the message is recorded in the message service first; undeliverable sends are dropped, since the device fetches later. [[src:book-acing]]",
  "track.sysdesign.m.chat.co.away.s4": "Alex Xu: if the recipient is offline the server sends a push notification; chapter I9: the push is only a signal, content comes from the server. [[src:book-xu1]]",
